 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-your-rights-as-a-ctec-preparer\"><div id=\"tcf-your-rights-as-a-ctec-preparer-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>",
 "ssr": "<div data-screen-label=\"Your Rights as a CTEC Preparer\" class=\"tcf-screen\"><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/photos/ctec-renewal-records.webp\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"/><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#95AB3B\">Resources</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.05 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;max-width:900px\">Your Rights as a CTEC Preparer</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:660px;text-wrap:pretty\">Key rights and protections you have when you study with a CTEC-approved school, whether you are taking the 60 hour course for the first time or the 20 hour course to renew.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B\">Compare CTEC-approved schools<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"flex:none;margin-left:2px\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a><a data-hv=\"17\" href=\"#rights\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5)\">See your rights</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div><div id=\"rights\" style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#fff;scroll-margin-top:var(--tcf-head,110px)\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Key rights &amp; protections</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">Your rights with <span style=\"font-weight:300\">CTEC-approved schools</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">What you can expect from any CTEC-approved education provider, and where to check.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">01</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Active provider verification</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">You have the right to choose from officially vetted, active education providers. Check any school\u2019s standing in the CTEC Find Education Provider directory before you enroll.<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:#5A6E78\">Source: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/find-education-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC Find Education Provider directory</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-choose-approved-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to choose an approved provider (CTEC)</a></span></p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">02</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Accurate curriculum &amp; hour compliance</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Approved schools must offer courses that meet CTEC requirements: 60 hours of qualifying education (QE) for new preparers, or 20 hours of continuing education (CE) to renew, including federal tax law, ethics and California updates.<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:#5A6E78\">Source: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC FAQs</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-choose-approved-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to choose an approved provider (CTEC)</a></span></p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">03</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Timely electronic reporting</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">You have the right to expect your provider to report completed CE and QE hours electronically to CTEC and the IRS in a timely manner, so your record does not lapse.<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:#5A6E78\">Source: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC for tax preparers</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://ctec.org/faqs/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC FAQs</a></span></p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">04</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Transparent policies &amp; refunds</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">You have the right to clear information before you pay: course costs, completion requirements such as minimum passing grades or attendance rules, and the refund policy.<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:#5A6E78\">Source: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-choose-approved-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to choose an approved provider (CTEC)</a></span></p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">05</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Filing complaints against providers</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">If a CTEC-approved school fails to meet standards, misrepresents a course or mishandles your records, CTEC has formal guidelines for course evaluations and provider complaints. Review CTEC\u2019s provider policies or contact CTEC directly.<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:17px;color:#5A6E78\">Source: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/education-providers/provider-policies/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC provider policies</a></span></p></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#F4F6F7\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n<div><div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330;margin-bottom:10px\">Questions</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 34px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">Common questions</h2></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">How do I check that a school is CTEC-approved?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Search the school in CTEC\u2019s <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/find-education-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Find an Education Provider</a> directory before you pay. Only hours from an approved provider count toward your registration.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Who reports my completed hours to CTEC?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Your education provider. CTEC-approved providers report completed CE and QE hours to CTEC and the IRS electronically, so your record stays current.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">What can I do if a school does not meet CTEC standards?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">CTEC has formal provider policies, including course evaluations and a complaint process. Review them on CTEC\u2019s <a href=\"https://ctec.org/education-providers/provider-policies/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">provider policies page</a> or contact CTEC directly.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:56px 56px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:18px;color:#0B2E40\">\n<div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 34px/1.15 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;color:#0B2E40\">Ready to choose a school?</h2><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:22px;color:#0B2E40\">Compare every CTEC-approved provider by price, format and current offers.</p></div>\n<a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B;flex:none\">Compare CTEC-approved schools<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"flex:none;margin-left:2px\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:0 56px 48px;background:#fff\"><p style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Rules summarized from the California Tax Education Council. Requirements and fees can change, so confirm with CTEC before you apply: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-choose-approved-provider/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to choose an approved provider (CTEC)</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://ctec.org/education-providers/provider-policies/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC provider policies</a>.</p></div></div>",
